# Placing a carried part: held by its ends, the free ghost, dropping on the bin, and click to place.
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/placing.drive /tmp/placing
# 2D profile so the coordinates are the same every run. Rows of the bin: Boattail (130, 495), Body tube (130, 360).
viewport 1280x800
scale 1
click "2D"

# ---- 1. A boattail from the bin, free: its ghost at the cursor with a ring at each end (hollow, ink-muted).
press (130, 495)
move (200, 495)
move (700, 200)
screenshot 1-free-with-end-markers.png

# ---- 2. Held by its middle with its fore end at the tail node (946, 314): the cursor is half a boattail aft of it. The fore end's
# ring fills with accent and the ghost snaps to the tail.
move (955, 318)
screenshot 2-snapped-by-its-end-to-the-tail.png
release (955, 318)
click "Undo"

# ---- 3. A part picked up off the rocket and carried over the bin: `Drop to delete` on the err soft ground; letting go deletes
# it (the body tube with everything it carries), and Undo brings it back.
press (600, 314)
move (590, 314)
move (400, 300)
move (150, 300)
screenshot 3-drop-to-delete.png
release (150, 300)
screenshot 4-deleted.png
click "Undo"

# ---- 4. A part from the bin carried over the bin: `Drop to put back`.
press (130, 360)
move (200, 360)
move (150, 300)
screenshot 5-drop-to-put-back.png
release (150, 300)

# ---- 5. Click to place, switched on in Preferences > Editor.
click "Edit"
click "Preferences…"
click "Editor"
click "Click to place"
screenshot 6-preferences-editor.png
click "Done"
press (130, 360)
move (200, 360)
move (600, 200)
release (600, 200)
move (640, 190)
screenshot 7-in-hand-no-button.png
move (955, 318)
screenshot 8-in-hand-snapped.png
click (955, 318)
screenshot 9-placed-by-a-click.png
click "Undo"

# ---- 6. The same cues in the light theme (still clicking to place: the part stays in hand over the bin until it is clicked).
click "Edit"
click "Preferences…"
click "Appearance"
click "Light"
click "Done"
press (600, 314)
move (590, 314)
move (400, 300)
move (150, 300)
screenshot 10-light-drop-to-delete.png
click (150, 300)
click "Undo"
press (130, 360)
move (200, 360)
move (150, 300)
screenshot 11-light-drop-to-put-back.png
click (150, 300)
